        // to the callee, leaving c.balance unchanged (it was zero before). The mutant (no value forwarded) will keep the value
        // inside c, so address(c).balance >= amount. Therefore the general rule we assert is that address(c).balance == 0.
        // This holds for the reference for all inputs; the mutant will violate it for some inputs (when amount > 0).

        assertTrue(bal == 0);
    }
}

